#: inc/class-privacy.php:37
msgid "With cart history on, ShopSocket keeps a record of each shopping cart on this site: the products it held, its value, when it was first and last seen, when the shopper left and whether it became an order, for the number of days set in its settings. For logged-in shoppers the cart is linked to their account; guests are known only by a random id their browser made. Journeys (the pages a shopper opened and how long each was open, as post and term ids) are kept separately for the number of months set in its settings, under that random browser id and never under an account."
msgstr ""

